Explore dungeons, collect monsters and uncover what happened to mankind in [b]In:Finity[/b], a new game mode for [b]Calmed by the Dark Leviathan[/b].

[previewyoutube=IIebsdrUSNE;full][/previewyoutube]

[img]{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/40776797/8a3efe3fb44c7bcea6da4c2e0b47e348429aea5a.png[/img]

Set XXXX years in the future, a woman wakes up in a cyber world, with no humans in sight, she begins her quest to search for other survivors and understand what is happening in this new reality .

[img]{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/40776797/836949d74c6c43a7e983427fce74261b3d420bad.png[/img]

[list]
[*] A dark connected  world;
[*] Upgrade your character for higher survival chances;
[*] +20 monsters to battle and collect;
[*] Turn based combat;
[*] Multiple endings.
[/list]
